        "headline": "First-Class Mail volumes experienced long-term declines across categories and methodology breaks.",
        "statements": [
          {
            "text": "First-Class advertising received (ads only) fell by 6,235.0 million pieces (-65.8%) from FY2000 to FY2023, across the FY2010 methodology break.",
